# Core dumps (a crashed browser in the Playwright container writes core.<pid> into its working
# directory, web/, several GB each): never committed.
core.[0-9]*
# tools/art/webify.py's intermediate staging output (docs/art/style-guide.md §6): every run mirrors
# the *whole* assets/art tree here, whether or not the asset shipped. The game only ever reads the
# WebPs copied by hand to web/public/art/, never this folder - never committed.
assets/art/web/
# UI5 Task 3: downloaded audio sources (tools/audio/sources.json records each URL and sha256). Never committed.
assets/audio/staging/
# Candidate loops built for a listening round (tools/audio/run_docker.sh --out), with their
# listening page: generated, never committed.
assets/audio/war-candidates/
assets/audio/lair-candidates/
# TTS bake-off samples and results (tools/tts/run_docker.sh): generated, never committed.
assets/tts-bakeoff/
